<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 03:38:09 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>独家：OpenAI 正在为求职者试行“任务面试”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/openai-piloting-mission-interview-for-job-candidates/</link><description>这个想法是为了测试候选人的想法，以及他们将如何为公司的目标做出贡献，即“确保通用人工智能（AGI）造福全人类”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2297777301-e1791234048908.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 00:58:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/openai-piloting-mission-interview-for-job-candidates/</guid></item><item><title>随着世界模型的热度越来越高，Nvidia 支持初创公司 Reactor</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/nvidia-backs-startup-reactor-buzz-grows-world-models/</link><description>随着世界模型在机器人训练和控制中找到新用途，Reactor 旨在提供运行它们所需的计算能力和软件。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Alberto-and-BryceReactor.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 00:42:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/nvidia-backs-startup-reactor-buzz-grows-world-models/</guid></item><item><title>萨姆·奥尔特曼表示，随着行业签署特朗普的自愿安全协议，世界应该接受人工智能发生的一些“坏事”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/sam-altman-ai-risks-bad-things-benefits-trump-voluntary-safety-pact-openai-regulation/</link><description>但奥特曼表示，“灾难性风险”是不可接受的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2297785644-e1791228585849.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 19:55:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/sam-altman-ai-risks-bad-things-benefits-trump-voluntary-safety-pact-openai-regulation/</guid></item><item><title>红龙虾 20 美元终极无尽虾惨败背后的真实故事：美国海鲜偶像如何迷失方向</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/01/red-lobster-endless-shrimp-bankruptcy-thai-union-private-equity-lawsuit/</link><description>一项诉讼称，灾难性的促销优惠导致了该连锁店的破产，这并不是一个错误，而是一个阴谋。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LOB_Micha-Huigen-illo_social-thumbnail.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/01/red-lobster-endless-shrimp-bankruptcy-thai-union-private-equity-lawsuit/</guid></item><item><title>人类“更有可能”失去控制：前人工智能内部人士证明安全修复措施可能是“稍后会脱落的胶带”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/new-york-city-council-hearing-openai-anthropic-ai-safety-google-meta/</link><description>前内部人士警告纽约市议会有关失去对人工智能的控制，而 OpenAI、Anthropic、Meta 和谷歌则无法说明风险有多大。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2298143533-e1791225531592.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 19:55:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/new-york-city-council-hearing-openai-anthropic-ai-safety-google-meta/</guid></item><item><title>我们应该逐步取消社会保障吗？两位经济学家在我面前争论了一个小时——然后同意富人必须付出代价</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/social-security-insolvent-wealthy-rich-pay-more/</link><description>特蕾莎·吉拉杜奇 (Teresa Ghilarducci) 表示：“获得社会保障资金的方式……将是最重要的。”罗米娜·博恰 (Romina Boccia) 同意他们将不得不“首当其冲”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-515331622-e1791227506756.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 20:06:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/social-security-insolvent-wealthy-rich-pay-more/</guid></item><item><title>体育博彩是美国人的新消遣方式，其规模比电影、音乐和博物馆加起来还要大，因为美国人的赌注金额高达 1,660 亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/gambling-america-favorite-thing-movies-arts-museums-music/</link><description>去年，美国人在体育上的赌注达到了 1660 亿美元，超过了好莱坞、音乐产业、书籍和博物馆的总和。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GettyImages-2260111493-e1784829071737.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 13:12:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/gambling-america-favorite-thing-movies-arts-museums-music/</guid></item><item><title>德克萨斯州商人因联邦扣押他的兰博基尼、法拉利、火鸟和数十辆汽车以偿还欺诈受害者而被判入联邦监狱 13 年</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/texas-businessman-car-fraud-wire-doj-lawsuit/</link><description>检察官称，克莱顿·艾利发起了一项虚假的国防部贷款计划，并利用受害者的身份为 90 多辆收集车提供资金。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-534275856-e1791232522557.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 21:25:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/texas-businessman-car-fraud-wire-doj-lawsuit/</guid></item><item><title>Nvidia 支持的 Reflection AI 推出了其第一个开放模型 Beam。这是否是美国与中国竞争的最佳机会？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/reflection-ai-unveils-beam-a-new-us-based-open-source-model-to-compete-with-china/</link><description>这家总部位于纽约的公司已经与美国政府机构达成了交易，并签署了价值数十亿美元的计算协议。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2266727338-e1791215800670.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 19:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/reflection-ai-unveils-beam-a-new-us-based-open-source-model-to-compete-with-china/</guid></item><item><title>根据 U-Haul 的数据，美国人各代人的迁移地点：婴儿潮一代选择卡罗莱纳州，Z 世代选择德克萨斯州和加利福尼亚州</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/where-americans-moving-generation-uhaul-boomers-gen-z-millennials-gen-x/</link><description>新的 U-Haul 数据显示，即使婴儿潮一代南下，Z 世代仍在迁往加州。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-1325864975.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 09:33:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/where-americans-moving-generation-uhaul-boomers-gen-z-millennials-gen-x/</guid></item></channel></rss>